@startuml
title Profile Page — История тестов

actor User
participant "ProfilePage" as Page
participant "UserController" as UC
participant "TestAttempt" as TA

User -> Page: click "История тестов"
Page -> UC: dispatch(fetchMyTestHistory(page=1, pageSize))
UC -> TA: findPaginated(userId, page, pageSize)
TA --> UC: rows[], count
UC --> Page: items[], total, totalPages
Page --> User: рендер таблицы истории прохождений тестов

User -> Page: click пагинация → setTestHistPage(n)
Page -> UC: dispatch(fetchMyTestHistory(page=n, pageSize))
UC -> TA: findPaginated(userId, n, pageSize)
TA --> UC: rows[], count
UC --> Page: items[], total, totalPages
Page --> User: страница n таблицы

User -> Page: click строку истории → просмотр результата
Page -> UC: dispatch(fetchAttemptResult(attemptId))
UC -> TA: findByPk(attemptId, include=Questions+Answers)
TA --> UC: attempt{ score, maxScore, questions[]{ isCorrect, userAnswer, correctAnswer } }
UC --> Page: attemptResult
Page --> User: модалка с детальным результатом

@enduml
